# Herald on mainnet, with its real-money checks (#14).
#
# Checks the production environment (D1, KV, both Workers and their
# secrets), migrates and deploys it if you say so, tops up the gas wallets
# and runs the live checks (v1.signer root keys, USDC EIP-712 domains). Then
# it makes one $0.001 payment on Base through Herald's facilitator, and one
# Sweep of under $1 from the Provider's Base Receiving Address into their
# NEAR Intents account through 1Click. Every step that spends real money
# waits for the owner's typed approval. It ends by posting the tx hashes,
# fees and timings on #14.
#
# The payment runs examples/weather-api locally with HERALD_ENV=mainnet,
# aimed at the mainnet facilitator, and pays it with its scripts/buy.ts.
#
# Public values and the Provider's hk_live_ key persist in
